### 1. Create Producer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/producers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Apple"
}

### 2. Create Product with Attributes
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MacBook Pro 16",
  "description": "M3 Max Chip",
  "price": 14999.00,
  "producerId": 1,
  "attributes": {
    "RAM": "36GB",
    "Disk": "1TB SSD",
    "Keyboard": "US",
    "Color": "Space Black"
  }
}

### Test Error - Non-existent Producer (Should return 404/500)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Laptop",
  "price": 100,
  "producerId": 999,
  "attributes": {}
}

### 3. Get All Products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 4. Search Products by Name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search?name=MacBook

### 5. Update Product (Change attributes)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MacBook Pro 16",
  "description": "M3 Max Chip - Updated",
  "price": 13999.00,
  "producerId": 1,
  "attributes": {
    "RAM": "64GB",
    "Color": "Silver"
  }
}

### 6. Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/1